        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/e68b1a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-07-09T08:53:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>question of Keeper of the Forbidden Wilds`s innate power 'spreading wild'</p>\n<p><br>\nif i have 2 sun, 1 plant.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>i trigger spreading wild to no blight and. in 1 exploror.</p>\n<p>i can push 1 exploror to another land.</p>\n<p>after, spreading wild`s target land has no exploror.</p>\n<p>and, can&nbsp;&nbsp;i place wild token to target land?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><i><b>FORBIDDEN GROUND&nbsp;</b></i>question.</p>\n<p>Sacredsite is only Keeper of the Forbidden Wilds`s 2 presence? maybe 2 to 3 is not? or, keeper`s 1 presence +another spirit`s 1 presence is can trigger this rule?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:56.556Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 180,
