        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>question of Keeper of the Forbidden Wilds`s innate power 'spreading wild'</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nif i have 2 sun, 1 plant.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>i trigger spreading wild to no blight and. in 1 exploror.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>i can push 1 exploror to another land.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>after, spreading wild`s target land has no exploror.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>and, can&nbsp;&nbsp;i place wild token to target land?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><i><b>FORBIDDEN GROUND&nbsp;</b></i>question.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sacredsite is only Keeper of the Forbidden Wilds`s 2 presence? maybe 2 to 3 is not? or, keeper`s 1 presence +another spirit`s 1 presence is can trigger this rule?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
